 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Service Quotas API (2019-06-24). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. GetServiceQuota reads the enforced B2B Data Interchange Profiles limit (b2bi/L-05F6A9EF) in us-east-1, us-west-2 and eu-west-1. Value is total capacity, including profiles already created. Adjustable describes the AWS quota. The simulator serves only account-level reads of this quota. Defaults, quota discovery, usage, resource contexts and increase requests are unsupported.",
  "title": "Service Quotas (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2019-06-24"
 },
